{"source":"github","project_id":"gggeom","target":"rstudio/gggeom","id":"issue/15","ref":15,"title":"Non-overlap","description":"Would be useful to have a positioning algorithm that arranged bounded rects so that they don't overlap.\n\nFor ggplot2, it would be important to be extremely fast so that it could be used in (e.g.) `geom_text()`\n","published_at":"2015-08-11T15:47:14Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/gggeom/issues/15","type":"issue","extra":{"author":"hadley","state":"OPEN"}}
